# Automatically generated by /usr/lib/systemd/user-generators/podman-user-generator
# 
# kb-analysis: deterministic state/plumbing service for the W1-W4 analysis
# pipelines (queue+verdicts in kb/state/queue.sqlite, RAGFlow tagging, report
# rendering). Windmill W1-W4 scripts call it over ai.network; it publishes NO host
# port. Shares the kb-watcher image (different entrypoint arg) and its env
